e treatment, fire fighting system, flood-control, boiler-feed, HVAC, organic and in organic chemical, dewatering, pressure boosting, agriculture, and domestic applications. It serves chemical and pharma, sugar, steel, cement, coal and mining, paper, food and beverages, textile, tyre, building and construction, oil and gas, power, marine and defence, water resource management, irrigation, and retail pumps markets. Kirloskar Brothers Limited was founded in 1888 and is headquartered in Pune, India."}}